NASA/JPL Horizons ephemeris snapshot
833 daily Earth-centre to Mars-centre observer calculations, 2023-11-20 through 2026-03-01. Retrieved 2026-11-14. Source: https://ssd.jpl.nasa.gov/horizons/ . Original API response and query retained in research/horizons-earth-mars.txt and research/horizons-query.json; derived local snapshot in game/horizons-snapshot.js. Used for educational signal-time modeling. NASA/JPL does not endorse this game.

Ares Atlas original art and implementation, November 2026
Custom colony architecture, material code, interface ornaments and suit animation
were authored for this project with AI assistance. Blender exports are in
game/assets/ares/. The fictional Martian guide portrait was generated with Grok
Imagine; its generation record is in game/assets/ares-ui/ARTWORK.md. The interface
identifies the portrait as fictional AI artwork. These are not NASA assets.
